        "content": "<p><strong>NO PURCHASE NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN THIS CONTEST. THIS CONTEST<br/>IS VOID WHERE PROHIBITED BY LAW.</strong></p><p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p><p>Participants must be at least 18 years of age and a resident of<br/>the United States at the time the Contest begins. The Fireside Hearth &<br/>Home “Stonefire Fire Table Giveaway” (“Contest”) is void outside the United<br/>States, or where prohibited or restricted by law.</p><p>This Contest is sponsored by Fireside Hearth & Home<br/>(“Sponsor”). All employees, officers, directors and agents and their immediate<br/>families or any members of their households, regardless of relationship, of<br/>Sponsor or any advertising agency or other company involved with the design,<br/>production, execution or distribution of this Contest are not eligible to<br/>participate in the Contest or to win any prizes.  Although the Contest<br/>will be held on the Instagram social media platform, Instagram is not in any<br/>way a sponsor of this Contest.  All posts must comply with Instagram’s<br/>rules and any applicable laws, rules, and regulations.  Additionally, all<br/>posts must not:</p><p>Any Contest entries received from an ineligible participant will<br/>be disqualified. By participating in this Contest, participants accept and<br/>agree to be bound by these rules and the decisions of the Sponsor, which shall<br/>be final on all matters. Failure to follow these rules will result in a<br/>participant being deemed ineligible.  Further, Sponsor reserves the right,<br/>in Sponsor’s sole discretion, to deem a participant ineligible if the<br/>participant (i) commits or is alleged to have committed any criminal act or<br/>other act involving moral turpitude, drugs, or felonious activities or commits<br/>any act or (ii) becomes involved in any situation or occurrence which brings<br/>the participant into public disrepute, contempt, scandal, or ridicule, or which<br/>shocks or offends the community or any group or class thereof, or which<br/>reflects unfavorably on Sponsor.  Sponsor reserves the right to modify the<br/>rules of the Contest in any way at any time, subject to state or federal law.</p><p><strong>Contest Period:</strong></p><p>The Contest begins on August 10, at 8:00 a.m. CST and ends on September<br/>23, at 11:59 p.m. CST (“Contest Period”). All entries must be received and<br/>recorded by the Sponsor during the Contest Period to be eligible.</p><p><strong>How To Enter:</strong></p><p>Participants can enter the Contest by completing the form at Fireside.com<br/>by providing their first and last name, email address, and zip code.  </p><p>Only one entry per customer is permitted.</p><p>Sponsor is not responsible for late or unsent entries, whether<br/>caused by the participant or any of the equipment, social media platforms, or<br/>programming associated with or used in this Contest, or by technical or human<br/>error that may occur in the transmittal of any entry or the processing of any<br/>function on the internet or the participant’s computer system.  Sponsor<br/>reserves the right, in its sole discretion, to disqualify any individual found<br/>to be tampering with the entry process or the operation of the Contest; to be<br/>acting in violation of these rules; or to be acting with intent to annoy,<br/>abuse, threaten or harass any other person. Any use of robotic, automatic,<br/>programmed or similar response methods will void all such entries submitted by<br/>such methods.</p><p><strong>Prizes:</strong></p><p>Contest participants will enter for a chance to win: </p><p>Stonefire Fire Table from Outdoor Greatroom Company, valued at $1,099.</p><p>The chances of winning depend on the number of entries<br/>received.  No transfer, assignment, cash redemption or substitution of any<br/>prize is permitted, except by Sponsor in Sponsor’s sole discretion due to prize<br/>availability and then with a prize of equal or greater value.</p><p><strong>Selection of Winner:</strong></p><p>Sponsor will notify winners via email.</p><p>Winners must respond within five (5) days of being notified or<br/>their prize may be forfeited, and another Contest participant chosen. The<br/>potential winner(s) must satisfactorily complete an affidavit of eligibility<br/>showing compliance with these Contest Rules and must also sign a liability and<br/>publicity release allowing Sponsor to use his or her information for<br/>advertising or other purposes. Failure to complete these forms may result in<br/>forfeiture of the prize.</p><p>If the potential winner is disqualified for any reason, the<br/>Sponsor may select an alternate potential winner.</p><p>Winner is solely responsible for all applicable federal, state<br/>or provincial, and local taxes and any expenses associated with any prizes.</p><p>The Sponsor reserves the right, in its sole discretion, to<br/>modify, terminate, or suspend this Contest should viruses, bugs, unauthorized<br/>human intervention or other causes beyond Sponsor’s control corrupt or impair<br/>the administration, security or fairness of the Contest. The Sponsor is not<br/>responsible for any human or technological error that may occur in the<br/>processing of the Contest nor are they responsible for any error, omission,<br/>interruption, deletion, defect, communications line failure, theft or destruction<br/>of, unauthorized access to, delay in operation, transmission, or distribution<br/>of, or alteration of entries, whether caused by the sender, any of the<br/>equipment or programming associated with or utilized in this Contest, or<br/>otherwise.</p><p><strong>Limitation of Liability and Dispute Resolution</strong></p><p>Except where prohibited, each participant and winner accepting a<br/>prize agrees that: (a) all conflicts, legal proceedings, issues, and questions<br/>concerning these rules shall be governed by Iowa law without giving effect to<br/>any principles of conflicts of law of any jurisdiction; (b) any and